# Title: Diskshadow Script Mode - Execution From Potential Suspicious Location
# ID: fa1a7e52-3d02-435b-81b8-00da14dd66c1
# Status: test
# Level: medium
# Author: Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
# Date: 2023-09-15
# Tags: attack.stealth, attack.t1218
# Description: Detects execution of "Diskshadow.exe" in script mode using the "/s" flag where the script is located in a potentially suspicious location.
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(((@CommandLine:*-s * OR @CommandLine:*/s *)) AND ((@OriginalFileName:"diskshadow.exe") OR (@Image:*\\diskshadow.exe)) AND ((@CommandLine:*:\\Temp\\* OR @CommandLine:*:\\Windows\\Temp\\* OR @CommandLine:*\\AppData\\Local\\* OR @CommandLine:*\\AppData\\Roaming\\* OR @CommandLine:*\\ProgramData\\* OR @CommandLine:*\\Users\\Public\\*)))
